$7A4B b BlankGlyph 8 ; An empty glyph: the HUD's unused icon places

@module interrupt ; The frame counter and wait, the RAM 1 calls (the music and its effects)
@about The IM 2 handler $FEFE increments FrameCounter $7A60 each interrupt; WaitFrames $7A53 waits until it reaches C and clears it, so the main loop (C = 2) runs a pass in two frames or more, and an interrupt lost while SP is borrowed slows the count.
@about On a 128K the music lives in RAM 1 at $C000. CallRam1 $7A77 pages RAM 1 in with interrupts off, calls HL with A, and pages RAM 0 back: MusicFrameCall $7AB6 every interrupt, StartTune $7AAD, PlayEffect $7A97. The entry code sets Machine48K $7A76 when it finds no RAM 1; then the calls return at once and the effects go to the beeper ($7ADA, $7B66).

$7A53 c WaitFrames ; Enable interrupts, wait until FrameCounter >= C, clear it
> C = the frames: 2 the main loop $7D8B (51 600), 1 the scroll steps, 10, 15, 20 the menus and texts ($7E9D, $8150, $82E4, $8743, $8784). 63 583 runs in 68 builds.
