@module score ; Lives, bullets and detonators
@about The three counters beside the section variables: lives, the ray gun's bullets and the detonators, each 0-6, drawn in the HUD by $79C3, $79D1 and $79DF.

$8B3B b Lives ; Rick's lives
> Set to 6 at a new game ($7CC2); a level start with fewer than 6 adds one ($7CE6; the bytes at $7CEE, INC A / LD ($8B3B),A: not executed in any recording); one off in LoseLife ($8A30, the POKE file's infinite lives); the main loop ends the game when Rick dies with 1 left ($7E10). Read by the HUD $79C3 and the end tally $8728.

$8B3C b Ammunition ; The ray gun's bullets
> 6 at every level start ($7CF4) and after a death ($8A41), 6 again from an ammunition pickup ($A528), also written by $A2F7; one off per shot ($9593, unless $8066). The HUD: $79D1.

$8B3D b Detonators ; The detonators (bombs)
> 6 at every level start ($7CF7) and after a death ($8A44), 6 from a pickup ($A528), also written by $A2F7; one off per bomb ($95ED, $96B4, $9B27, unless $8066). The HUD: $79DF.

@module objects ; The section's map entries: the scan that spawns them
@about A section's map entry list (its address in SectionEntries, set from the section table) is sorted by row. FindFirstMapEntry sets ScanStart to the first entry at or below the view's top row whenever the view is built; ScanMapObjects goes through the list from there every pass and spawns ($9C97) the entries that come into the view or whose trigger boxes fire ($A69F).

$8B3E w SectionEntries 1 ; The section's map entry list (0: none)
> Set by SetupSection ($8AD5) from the section table's +6/+7; read by FindFirstMapEntry.

$8B40 w ScanStart 1 ; The first map entry at or below the view's top row (0: none)
> Set by FindFirstMapEntry after every BuildView; read by ScanMapObjects each pass.

$8B42 c ScanMapObjects ; Spawn the map entries that come into the view or whose trigger boxes fire
> Returns at once while LevelHookOn is set or the list is empty. From ScanStart, entry by entry (4 bytes and +3 bits 0-1 boxes of 4 bytes after it), until the 0 end or an entry whose row is ViewTop + 40 or more: an entry already alive (+0 bit 7) is skipped. With +2 bit 7 set the entry spawns when its row is in the view's first 8 rows or above the top or 32 rows or more below it (the rows the scroll brings in; every row while SpawnWholeView is set); the rows between are skipped. With +2 bit 7 clear its trigger boxes are tested ($A69F with BC = 0) and it spawns when one fires. A spawn is $9C97 with IX at the entry.
> Called each pass by the main loop ($7D75, 50 161) and by SetupSection ($8AFE, 95). Witness: 50 256 runs in 65 builds; 1982 spawns ($8B96).
> Witness: L1 119401 (cheats, controls-cursor, controls-kempston, controls-keyboard, controls-sinclair, end-congrats, long-l4, rzx-l1-00000-poke, rzx-l1-02000-poke, rzx-l1-04000-poke, rzx-l1-06000-poke, rzx-l1-08000-poke, rzx-l1-10000-poke, rzx-l1-12000-poke, rzx-l1-14000-poke, rzx-l1-16000-poke, rzx-l1-18000-poke, rzx-l1-20000-poke, rzx-l1-22000-poke, rzx-l1-24000-poke, rzx-l2-00000-poke, rzx-l2-02000-poke, rzx-l2-04000-poke, rzx-l2-06000-poke, rzx-l2-08000-poke, rzx-l2-10000-poke, rzx-l2-12000-poke, rzx-l2-14000-poke, rzx-l2-16000-poke, rzx-l2-18000-poke, rzx-l2-20000-poke, rzx-l2-22000-poke, rzx-l2-24000-poke, rzx-l3-00000-poke, rzx-l3-02000-poke, rzx-l3-04000-poke, rzx-l3-06000-poke, rzx-l3-08000-poke, rzx-l3-10000-poke, rzx-l4-00000-poke, rzx-l4-02000-poke, rzx-l4-04000-poke, rzx-l4-06000-poke, rzx-l4-08000-poke, rzx-l4-10000-poke, rzx-l4-12000-poke, rzx-l4-14000-poke, rzx-l4-16000-poke, rzx-l4-18000-poke, rzx-l4-20000-poke, rzx-l5-00000-poke, rzx-l5-02000-poke, rzx-l5-04000-poke, rzx-l5-06000-poke, rzx-l5-08000-poke, rzx-l5-10000-poke, rzx-l5-12000-poke, rzx-l5-14000-poke, rzx-l5-16000-poke, rzx-l5-18000-poke, rzx-l5-20000-poke, rzx-l5-22000-poke, rzx-l5-full, sec-l1-s8, c1, c48, load-l2-load-l5, sec-l2-s7, sec-l2-s10-sec-l2-s12, sec-l3-s3-sec-l3-s5, sec-l3-s7-sec-l3-s9, sec-l4-s x5, sec-l5-s3, sec-l5-s5).

