@module enemies ; The enemies: walkers, chasers, patrols; gravity, ladders, death
@about The enemies live in the 23-byte records at $7C20 (to the $FF end mark), run once a pass by UpdateEnemy from $865D: +0 the kind (bits 0-1: 0 and 3 wander, 1 patrols, 2 chases Rick; 3 also climbs ladders after Rick; bit 2 clear takes the second sprite set, 6 sprites on), +1 x, +2/+3 y, +4/+5 the sprite, +6 the x step (2 or -2; bit 7 the mirror), +9 the walk frame counter, +$0A/+$0B a script nothing reads, +$0C/+$0D the map entry, +$0E/+$0F the vertical speed (8.8 fixed point, pixels a pass), +$10 the y fraction, +$11 climbing ($FF), +$12 the patrol step count, +$13 the patrol length, +$14 dying ($FF), +$15 the dying drift, +$16 the stun timer.
@about The sprites are fixed: walking Sprites 28-30 (EnemyWalkSprites), dying 31, climbing 32-33, each +6 for the other set. Gravity adds $80 a pass up to 8 pixels; $8FF9 probes the cell flags under the new place and leaves them in $915E (here: bit 5 kills, bits 1-2 floor or wall, bit 3 and 4 ladder, bit 6 a step with its y in $915F; the bits' names to be checked against $8FF9).

$9EAF c UpdateEnemy ; One pass of the enemy at IX
> A dying enemy goes to EnemyFalling. Otherwise the step flags EnemyOnStep and EnemyOnGround are cleared and the behaviour (+0 bits 0-1) chosen: 1 EnemyPatrol, 2 EnemyChaser, 0 and 3 EnemyWanderer.
> Evidence: 41 073 runs in 59 builds (load-l2 873, load-l3 558, load-l4 634, the rzx pieces; none in c1 or the controls-* recordings), all from $8695.
> Witness: L1 103099 (cheats, end-congrats, long-l4, rzx-l1-00000-poke, rzx-l1-02000-poke, rzx-l1-04000-poke, rzx-l1-06000-poke, rzx-l1-08000-poke, rzx-l1-10000-poke, rzx-l1-12000-poke, rzx-l1-14000-poke, rzx-l1-16000-poke, rzx-l1-18000-poke, rzx-l1-20000-poke, rzx-l1-22000-poke, rzx-l1-24000-poke, rzx-l2-00000-poke, rzx-l2-02000-poke, rzx-l2-04000-poke, rzx-l2-06000-poke, rzx-l2-08000-poke, rzx-l2-10000-poke, rzx-l2-12000-poke, rzx-l2-14000-poke, rzx-l2-16000-poke, rzx-l2-18000-poke, rzx-l2-20000-poke, rzx-l2-22000-poke, rzx-l2-24000-poke, rzx-l3-00000-poke, rzx-l3-02000-poke, rzx-l3-04000-poke, rzx-l3-06000-poke, rzx-l3-08000-poke, rzx-l3-10000-poke, rzx-l4-00000-poke, rzx-l4-02000-poke, rzx-l4-04000-poke, rzx-l4-06000-poke, rzx-l4-08000-poke, rzx-l4-10000-poke, rzx-l4-12000-poke, rzx-l4-14000-poke, rzx-l4-16000-poke, rzx-l4-18000-poke, rzx-l4-20000-poke, rzx-l5-00000-poke, rzx-l5-02000-poke, rzx-l5-04000-poke, rzx-l5-06000-poke, rzx-l5-10000-poke, rzx-l5-12000-poke, rzx-l5-14000-poke, rzx-l5-16000-poke, rzx-l5-18000-poke, rzx-l5-20000-poke, rzx-l5-22000-poke, rzx-l5-full, c48, load-l2-load-l5, sec-l2-s7, sec-l2-s10-sec-l2-s12, sec-l3-s5, sec-l3-s8, sec-l4-s2, sec-l4-s6, sec-l4-s11, sec-l4-s12, sec-l5-s3, sec-l5-s5).
$9EB6 ; EnemyOnStep and EnemyOnGround cleared

$9ECE c EnemyHitsAndSprite ; Test what hits the enemy, then pick its sprite
> $8BF3 tests the bullet, the detonator's blast, the punch box (a stun: +$16 = 40 passes, effect 9) and Rick (Rick dies, $93D0); C (the bullet or the blast hit) kills the enemy (KillEnemy). A stunned enemy keeps its sprite. A climbing one alternates Sprites 32 and 33 every two passes; a walking one takes EnemyWalkSprites[(+9 / 4)] and +9 moves on by 2 (wrapping at 12): a new frame every second pass.
> The step 1 ($9F32) and step 4 ($9F3B) need EnemyAnimSlow or EnemyAnimFast, which nothing writes: not executed in any recording. Witness: 37 761 runs in 55 builds (from EnemyWanderer 6166, EnemyChaser 9107, EnemyPatrol 22 488); KillEnemy from here 7 times.
> Witness: L1 95909 (cheats, rzx-l1-00000-poke, rzx-l1-02000-poke, rzx-l1-04000-poke, rzx-l1-06000-poke, rzx-l1-08000-poke, rzx-l1-10000-poke, rzx-l1-12000-poke, rzx-l1-14000-poke, rzx-l1-16000-poke, rzx-l1-20000-poke, rzx-l1-22000-poke, rzx-l1-24000-poke, rzx-l2-00000-poke, rzx-l2-02000-poke, rzx-l2-04000-poke, rzx-l2-06000-poke, rzx-l2-08000-poke, rzx-l2-10000-poke, rzx-l2-12000-poke, rzx-l2-14000-poke, rzx-l2-16000-poke, rzx-l2-18000-poke, rzx-l2-20000-poke, rzx-l2-22000-poke, rzx-l3-00000-poke, rzx-l3-02000-poke, rzx-l3-04000-poke, rzx-l3-06000-poke, rzx-l3-08000-poke, rzx-l3-10000-poke, rzx-l4-00000-poke, rzx-l4-02000-poke, rzx-l4-04000-poke, rzx-l4-06000-poke, rzx-l4-08000-poke, rzx-l4-10000-poke, rzx-l4-12000-poke, rzx-l4-14000-poke, rzx-l4-16000-poke, rzx-l4-18000-poke, rzx-l5-00000-poke, rzx-l5-02000-poke, rzx-l5-04000-poke, rzx-l5-06000-poke, rzx-l5-10000-poke, rzx-l5-12000-poke, rzx-l5-14000-poke, rzx-l5-16000-poke, rzx-l5-18000-poke, rzx-l5-20000-poke, rzx-l5-full, c48, load-l2-load-l5, sec-l2-s7, sec-l2-s10-sec-l2-s12, sec-l3-s5, sec-l3-s8, sec-l4-s2, sec-l4-s6, sec-l4-s11, sec-l4-s12, sec-l5-s3, sec-l5-s5).
