$9F4C b EnemyMoveFlags 4 ; The enemy movement flags of the current pass
> +0 EnemyOnStep: $FF when EnemyVertical found a step (probe bit 6) under the enemy; +1 EnemyOnGround: $FF when the enemy stands (landed, or EnemyOnStep copied by EnemyWalk). Both cleared by UpdateEnemy, written by EnemyVertical, read by EnemyWalk. +2 EnemyAnimFast and +3 EnemyAnimSlow are read by EnemyHitsAndSprite and never written (always 0).
