$A0A1 c EnemyVertical ; An enemy's vertical move: gravity, landing, ceilings, steps, ladders
> A climbing enemy goes to EnemyClimb. Otherwise speed += $80 (to 8 pixels a pass), the new y probed ($8FF9) at x. A deadly cell (bit 5) kills (KillEnemy). A step (bit 6): EnemyOnStep set, the enemy put on the step's y ($915F - 21), speed 1, probed again; a floor there lands it (EnemyHitCeiling's snap), else the probe bits $42 are forced. A ladder (bit 4) under a behaviour-3 enemy at x AND 15 = 4 with Rick above starts the climb (+$11 = $FF). A floor while falling (or bit 2) lands it (EnemyLand: EnemyOnGround, y snapped to the cell, speed 1); a ceiling while rising (bit 1 only) stops the rise (EnemyHitCeiling); no floor: the new y stored, and an enemy that fell out of the view is freed (FreeObject).
> Evidence: 37 765 runs in 55 builds; the landing 34 085, the ceiling snap 16 (rzx-l5-14000-poke only), the climb 786 (13 builds).
> Witness: L1 95917 (cheats, rzx-l1-00000-poke, rzx-l1-02000-poke, rzx-l1-04000-poke, rzx-l1-06000-poke, rzx-l1-08000-poke, rzx-l1-10000-poke, rzx-l1-12000-poke, rzx-l1-14000-poke, rzx-l1-16000-poke, rzx-l1-20000-poke, rzx-l1-22000-poke, rzx-l1-24000-poke, rzx-l2-00000-poke, rzx-l2-02000-poke, rzx-l2-04000-poke, rzx-l2-06000-poke, rzx-l2-08000-poke, rzx-l2-10000-poke, rzx-l2-12000-poke, rzx-l2-14000-poke, rzx-l2-16000-poke, rzx-l2-18000-poke, rzx-l2-20000-poke, rzx-l2-22000-poke, rzx-l3-00000-poke, rzx-l3-02000-poke, rzx-l3-04000-poke, rzx-l3-06000-poke, rzx-l3-08000-poke, rzx-l3-10000-poke, rzx-l4-00000-poke, rzx-l4-02000-poke, rzx-l4-04000-poke, rzx-l4-06000-poke, rzx-l4-08000-poke, rzx-l4-10000-poke, rzx-l4-12000-poke, rzx-l4-14000-poke, rzx-l4-16000-poke, rzx-l4-18000-poke, rzx-l5-00000-poke, rzx-l5-02000-poke, rzx-l5-04000-poke, rzx-l5-06000-poke, rzx-l5-10000-poke, rzx-l5-12000-poke, rzx-l5-14000-poke, rzx-l5-16000-poke, rzx-l5-18000-poke, rzx-l5-20000-poke, rzx-l5-full, c48, load-l2-load-l5, sec-l2-s7, sec-l2-s10-sec-l2-s12, sec-l3-s5, sec-l3-s8, sec-l4-s2, sec-l4-s6, sec-l4-s11, sec-l4-s12, sec-l5-s3, sec-l5-s5).
