$A213 c EnemyWalk ; An enemy's horizontal move: D = the x step
> A stunned enemy (+$16) counts down and stands. A climbing one does not walk. An enemy on a step walks with the push $9161 alone (D = 0); one standing on a moving thing with $9162 set stands (+9 = 0). An enemy in the air does not walk (+9 = 0). Otherwise x += D + the push $9161, turning at the edges 0 and $E8; the new x probed ($8FF9, C = $FF): a wall (bit 1) turns it and snaps x to the cell edge; at x AND 15 = 4 a ladder top (bit 3) under a behaviour-3 enemy with Rick above starts the climb.
> Evidence: 37 763 runs in 55 builds; the wall turn on the right 144 runs (27 builds).
> Witness: L1 95913 (cheats, rzx-l1-00000-poke, rzx-l1-02000-poke, rzx-l1-04000-poke, rzx-l1-06000-poke, rzx-l1-08000-poke, rzx-l1-10000-poke, rzx-l1-12000-poke, rzx-l1-14000-poke, rzx-l1-16000-poke, rzx-l1-20000-poke, rzx-l1-22000-poke, rzx-l1-24000-poke, rzx-l2-00000-poke, rzx-l2-02000-poke, rzx-l2-04000-poke, rzx-l2-06000-poke, rzx-l2-08000-poke, rzx-l2-10000-poke, rzx-l2-12000-poke, rzx-l2-14000-poke, rzx-l2-16000-poke, rzx-l2-18000-poke, rzx-l2-20000-poke, rzx-l2-22000-poke, rzx-l3-00000-poke, rzx-l3-02000-poke, rzx-l3-04000-poke, rzx-l3-06000-poke, rzx-l3-08000-poke, rzx-l3-10000-poke, rzx-l4-00000-poke, rzx-l4-02000-poke, rzx-l4-04000-poke, rzx-l4-06000-poke, rzx-l4-08000-poke, rzx-l4-10000-poke, rzx-l4-12000-poke, rzx-l4-14000-poke, rzx-l4-16000-poke, rzx-l4-18000-poke, rzx-l5-00000-poke, rzx-l5-02000-poke, rzx-l5-04000-poke, rzx-l5-06000-poke, rzx-l5-10000-poke, rzx-l5-12000-poke, rzx-l5-14000-poke, rzx-l5-16000-poke, rzx-l5-18000-poke, rzx-l5-20000-poke, rzx-l5-full, c48, load-l2-load-l5, sec-l2-s7, sec-l2-s10-sec-l2-s12, sec-l3-s5, sec-l3-s8, sec-l4-s2, sec-l4-s6, sec-l4-s11, sec-l4-s12, sec-l5-s3, sec-l5-s5).
