$A2F7 c UpdateTrap ; One pass of the trap or pickup at IX: path, animation, deadly touch, triggers
> The pickups ($21, $29, $2D) go to UpdatePickup with their sprite (Sprites 27, 25, 26). A paused trap (+0 bit 1) skips to the trigger test. Otherwise the path is read: effects played, a loop point followed (and there a one-shot trap is retired, a waiting trap switched to its second path by SwitchTrapPath, behaviour $14 marked to be freed at the next end), a step applied: x += the x step (a trap leaving 0-$E8 is freed), y += the y step (one leaving the view is freed), the step count moved on. Then AnimateTrap.
> A deadly trap (+0 bit 6) with a sprite: with bit 7 and the detonator's blast at phase 10 or more, the blast test ($A41C, not executed in any recording: effect 5, the phase set to 9); then every live enemy it overlaps is killed (KillEnemy, 111 times), and Rick, unless already dying ($9B9C), dies ($93D0 at $A475) when it overlaps him ($8D53).
> Then the trap's own trigger boxes (TestTriggerBoxes with the map entry): see $A478.
> Evidence: 148 725 runs in 61 builds (c1 616), all from $867A; Rick's overlap test 83 559 runs (the CALL C at $A475, which the POKE file's trap immunity patches); behaviour $0C removed by its trigger 432 times ($A4C0), behaviour $1C on release 9 ($A4A7).
> Witness: L1 345924 (cheats, end-congrats, long-l4, rzx-l1-00000-poke, rzx-l1-02000-poke, rzx-l1-04000-poke, rzx-l1-06000-poke, rzx-l1-08000-poke, rzx-l1-10000-poke, rzx-l1-12000-poke, rzx-l1-14000-poke, rzx-l1-16000-poke, rzx-l1-18000-poke, rzx-l1-20000-poke, rzx-l1-22000-poke, rzx-l1-24000-poke, rzx-l2-00000-poke, rzx-l2-02000-poke, rzx-l2-04000-poke, rzx-l2-06000-poke, rzx-l2-08000-poke, rzx-l2-10000-poke, rzx-l2-12000-poke, rzx-l2-14000-poke, rzx-l2-16000-poke, rzx-l2-18000-poke, rzx-l2-20000-poke, rzx-l2-22000-poke, rzx-l2-24000-poke, rzx-l3-00000-poke, rzx-l3-02000-poke, rzx-l3-04000-poke, rzx-l3-06000-poke, rzx-l3-08000-poke, rzx-l3-10000-poke, rzx-l4-00000-poke, rzx-l4-02000-poke, rzx-l4-04000-poke, rzx-l4-06000-poke, rzx-l4-08000-poke, rzx-l4-10000-poke, rzx-l4-12000-poke, rzx-l4-14000-poke, rzx-l4-16000-poke, rzx-l4-18000-poke, rzx-l4-20000-poke, rzx-l5-00000-poke, rzx-l5-02000-poke, rzx-l5-04000-poke, rzx-l5-06000-poke, rzx-l5-08000-poke, rzx-l5-10000-poke, rzx-l5-12000-poke, rzx-l5-14000-poke, rzx-l5-16000-poke, rzx-l5-18000-poke, rzx-l5-20000-poke, rzx-l5-22000-poke, rzx-l5-full, c1, c48, load-l2-load-l5, sec-l2-s7, sec-l2-s10-sec-l2-s12, sec-l3-s5, sec-l3-s7-sec-l3-s9, sec-l4-s x5, sec-l5-s3, sec-l5-s5).
