$A528 c UpdatePickup ; A pickup: a treasure ($21), ammunition ($29) or detonators ($2D)
> HL: its sprite. The record is set to 24 x 21 pixels. While Rick lives ($9B9C = 0) and overlaps it ($8DDF with Rick's x $9BAC + 4, y $9BAD, 16 x 21): a treasure gives 500 points (the digits at $7EFF through $7ED3, effect 7); ammunition sets the bullets $8B3C to 6 ($79D1 redraws them); detonators set $8B3D to 6 ($79DF); effect 6 for both; the pickup is retired.
> Not taken: an ammunition or detonator box hit by the bullet ($A5E4) or by the detonator's blast at phase 4-9 ($A5F7) bursts (effect 5, ten frames from the table $93C0 by the burst counter +$0E, PickupBurst, then retired): none of these ran in any recording.
> Evidence: 20 424 runs in 47 builds (from $A301 3685, $A309 1820, $A311 2825; c1 none); taken: a treasure 28 times ($A58D, 18 builds), ammunition 13 ($A59B 25 less $A5B0 12), detonators 12 ($A5B0, 11 builds).
> Witness: L1 48852 (cheats, rzx-l1-00000-poke, rzx-l1-02000-poke, rzx-l1-04000-poke, rzx-l1-06000-poke, rzx-l1-10000-poke, rzx-l1-12000-poke, rzx-l1-14000-poke, rzx-l1-16000-poke, rzx-l1-20000-poke, rzx-l1-22000-poke, rzx-l2-00000-poke, rzx-l2-04000-poke, rzx-l2-06000-poke, rzx-l2-08000-poke, rzx-l2-10000-poke, rzx-l2-12000-poke, rzx-l2-14000-poke, rzx-l2-16000-poke, rzx-l2-20000-poke, rzx-l2-22000-poke, rzx-l2-24000-poke, rzx-l3-00000-poke, rzx-l3-04000-poke, rzx-l3-06000-poke, rzx-l3-08000-poke, rzx-l3-10000-poke, rzx-l4-02000-poke, rzx-l4-04000-poke, rzx-l4-06000-poke, rzx-l4-08000-poke, rzx-l4-12000-poke, rzx-l4-14000-poke, rzx-l4-16000-poke, rzx-l4-18000-poke, rzx-l5-00000-poke, rzx-l5-02000-poke, rzx-l5-04000-poke, rzx-l5-06000-poke, rzx-l5-08000-poke, rzx-l5-10000-poke, rzx-l5-12000-poke, rzx-l5-16000-poke, rzx-l5-18000-poke, rzx-l5-20000-poke, rzx-l5-full, load-l2, load-l5, sec-l2-s7, sec-l2-s10, sec-l2-s11, sec-l3-s5, sec-l3-s9, sec-l4-s2, sec-l5-s5).
