$A608 c AnimateTrap ; Advance the trap's animation script and set its sprite
> +9 counts the passes a frame stays. The script (+$0A/+$0B) is read: $FD n plays effect n (TrapEffect), $FF and an address jumps, $80+n then a frame shows the frame n passes, a byte below $80 is a frame. Frame $7F hides the trap (+4/+5 = 0); otherwise SpriteFrameMap[frame - 1] gives the sprite number (bit 7: mirrored, +6 bit 7; $7F: no sprite) and the sprite address Sprites + n x 128.
> A script address below $100 ($A61B: the frame is the low byte itself) is not executed in any recording. Witness: 127 532 runs in 60 builds (all from $A3E8); a new frame 76 384 times.
> Witness: L1 295451 (cheats, end-congrats, long-l4, rzx-l1-00000-poke, rzx-l1-02000-poke, rzx-l1-04000-poke, rzx-l1-06000-poke, rzx-l1-08000-poke, rzx-l1-10000-poke, rzx-l1-12000-poke, rzx-l1-14000-poke, rzx-l1-16000-poke, rzx-l1-18000-poke, rzx-l1-20000-poke, rzx-l1-22000-poke, rzx-l1-24000-poke, rzx-l2-00000-poke, rzx-l2-02000-poke, rzx-l2-04000-poke, rzx-l2-06000-poke, rzx-l2-08000-poke, rzx-l2-10000-poke, rzx-l2-12000-poke, rzx-l2-14000-poke, rzx-l2-16000-poke, rzx-l2-18000-poke, rzx-l2-20000-poke, rzx-l2-22000-poke, rzx-l3-00000-poke, rzx-l3-02000-poke, rzx-l3-04000-poke, rzx-l3-06000-poke, rzx-l3-08000-poke, rzx-l3-10000-poke, rzx-l4-00000-poke, rzx-l4-02000-poke, rzx-l4-04000-poke, rzx-l4-06000-poke, rzx-l4-08000-poke, rzx-l4-10000-poke, rzx-l4-12000-poke, rzx-l4-14000-poke, rzx-l4-16000-poke, rzx-l4-18000-poke, rzx-l4-20000-poke, rzx-l5-00000-poke, rzx-l5-02000-poke, rzx-l5-04000-poke, rzx-l5-06000-poke, rzx-l5-08000-poke, rzx-l5-10000-poke, rzx-l5-12000-poke, rzx-l5-14000-poke, rzx-l5-16000-poke, rzx-l5-18000-poke, rzx-l5-20000-poke, rzx-l5-22000-poke, rzx-l5-full, c1, c48, load-l2-load-l5, sec-l2-s7, sec-l2-s11, sec-l2-s12, sec-l3-s5, sec-l3-s7-sec-l3-s9, sec-l4-s x5, sec-l5-s3, sec-l5-s5).
