$A69F c TestTriggerBoxes ; Test the trigger boxes after the map entry at IX: C when one fires
> IX: a map entry; its +3 bits 0-1 give the number of 4-byte boxes after it. BC: the record to leave out of the trap test (UpdateTrap's own record; 0 from the map scan), kept in the alternate set (EXX). For each box in turn: its rows are clipped to the view (a box above the view or 32 rows below ends the test with NC), then, as its +3 bits ask, tested against Rick ($8D53, skipped while he dies), the bullet ($8C8D; a hit sets BulletSpent so $865D removes the bullet), the detonator's blast at phase 5-10 ($8CAE), the punch box $9BA3 ($8C6C), each live enemy ($8DA3) and each other trap ($8DDF).
> A box that hits and has bit 7 clear fires: returns C with IX at the box, and sets bit 7 unless bit 6 asks it to fire on every pass. A box that hits with bit 7 set is passed over; one that misses has bit 7 cleared. No box fired: NC.
> Callers: the map scan $8BAC ($8BB5, 128 087: spawns the entry on C) and UpdateTrap ($A497, 105 179). Witness: 233 266 runs in 64 builds (all recordings); a fire 2030 times; the enemy test only in rzx-l3-00000/02000/04000-poke.
> Witness: L1 553212 (cheats, controls-cursor, controls-kempston, controls-keyboard, controls-sinclair, end-congrats, long-l4, rzx-l1-00000-poke, rzx-l1-02000-poke, rzx-l1-04000-poke, rzx-l1-06000-poke, rzx-l1-08000-poke, rzx-l1-10000-poke, rzx-l1-12000-poke, rzx-l1-14000-poke, rzx-l1-16000-poke, rzx-l1-18000-poke, rzx-l1-20000-poke, rzx-l1-22000-poke, rzx-l1-24000-poke, rzx-l2-00000-poke, rzx-l2-02000-poke, rzx-l2-04000-poke, rzx-l2-06000-poke, rzx-l2-08000-poke, rzx-l2-10000-poke, rzx-l2-12000-poke, rzx-l2-14000-poke, rzx-l2-16000-poke, rzx-l2-18000-poke, rzx-l2-20000-poke, rzx-l2-22000-poke, rzx-l3-00000-poke, rzx-l3-02000-poke, rzx-l3-04000-poke, rzx-l3-06000-poke, rzx-l3-08000-poke, rzx-l3-10000-poke, rzx-l4-00000-poke, rzx-l4-02000-poke, rzx-l4-04000-poke, rzx-l4-06000-poke, rzx-l4-08000-poke, rzx-l4-10000-poke, rzx-l4-12000-poke, rzx-l4-14000-poke, rzx-l4-16000-poke, rzx-l4-18000-poke, rzx-l4-20000-poke, rzx-l5-00000-poke, rzx-l5-02000-poke, rzx-l5-04000-poke, rzx-l5-06000-poke, rzx-l5-08000-poke, rzx-l5-10000-poke, rzx-l5-12000-poke, rzx-l5-14000-poke, rzx-l5-16000-poke, rzx-l5-18000-poke, rzx-l5-20000-poke, rzx-l5-22000-poke, rzx-l5-full, c1, c48, load-l2-load-l5, sec-l2-s7, sec-l2-s10-sec-l2-s12, sec-l3-s3-sec-l3-s5, sec-l3-s7-sec-l3-s9, sec-l4-s x5, sec-l5-s3, sec-l5-s5).
