$A7F0 b BulletSpent ; $FF: the bullet hit a trigger box this pass
> Written $FF by TestTriggerBoxes ($A734) and by the unexecuted pickup shot ($A5E6); $865D reads it after the bullet's move, clears it and switches the bullet off ($9BB4 = 0).
$A7F1 s ImageEndPad ; Zeros to the end of the game image ($A7FF); the level starts at $A800
> No recording reads them (l1q: the loader's writes only).
